cost` & `code_execution_cost`\n          factors of the dynamic cost of the `CALL` opcode.\n      2.) This function should *directly* precede the external call if possible. There is an\n          added buffer to account for gas consumed between this check and the call, but it\n          is only 5,700 gas.\n      3.) Because EIP-150 ensures that a maximum of 63/64ths of the remaining gas in the call\n          frame may be passed to a subcontext, we need to ensure that the gas will not be\n          truncated.\n      4.) Use wisely. This function is not a silver bullet."},"implemented":true,"kind":"function","modifiers":[],"name":"hasMinGas","nameLocation":"4384:9:106","parameters":{"id":61911,"nodeType":"ParameterList","parameters":[{"constant":false,"id":61908,"mutability":"mutable","name":"_minGas","nameLocation":"4402:7:106","nodeType":"VariableDeclaration","scope":61922,"src":"4394:15:106","stateVariable":false,"storageLocation":"default","typeDescriptions":{"typeIdentifier":"t_uint256","typeString":"uint256"},"typeName":{"id":61907,"name":"uint256","nodeType":"ElementaryTypeName","src":"4394:7:106","typeDescriptions":{"typeIdentifier":"t_uint256","typeString":"uint256"}},"visibility":"internal"},{"constant":false,"id":61910,"mutability":"mutable","name":"_reservedGas","nameLocation":"4419:12:106","nodeType":"VariableDeclaration","scope":61922,"src":"4411:20:106","stateVariable":false,"storageLocation":"default","typeDescriptions":{"typeIdentifier":"t_uint256","typeString":"uint256"},"typeName":{"id":61909,"name":"uint256","nodeType":"ElementaryTypeName","src":"4411:7:106","typeDescriptions":{"typeIdentifier":"t_uint256","typeString":"uint256"}},"visibility":"internal"}],"src":"4393:39:106"},"returnParameters":{"id":61914,"nodeType":"ParameterList","parameters":[{"constant":false,"id":61913,"mutability":"mutable","name":"","nameLocation":"-1:-1:-1","nodeType":"VariableDeclaration","scope":61922,"src":"4456:4:106","stateVariable":false,"storageLocation":"default"